27
00:00:30,111 --> 00:00:31,518
para no caerse.

28
00:00:31,518 --> 00:00:33,398
Esa técnica se
llama Euphoria,

29
00:00:33,398 --> 00:00:34,353
y Rockstar la usa

30
00:00:34,353 --> 00:00:35,532
desde GTA IV,

31
00:00:35,532 --> 00:00:36,836
en 2008.

32
00:00:36,836 --> 00:00:37,510
Por eso no hay

33
00:00:37,510 --> 00:00:39,258
